{"id":7,"date":"2020-08-11T20:05:59","date_gmt":"2020-08-11T20:05:59","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/?page_id=7"},"modified":"2024-08-12T21:39:11","modified_gmt":"2024-08-12T20:39:11","slug":"home","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/home\/","title":{"rendered":"About"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"wp-block-image is-resized is-style-rounded\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"685\" height=\"685\" data-attachment-id=\"1717\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/ant-2\/\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/ant-edited.jpg?fit=1512%2C1513&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1512,1513\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"ant\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/ant-edited.jpg?fit=685%2C685&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/consult-ant.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/05\/ant-edited.jpg?resize=685%2C685&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1717\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">My name is Ant &#8211; welcome to my blog where I share the things I have learned, found interesting, or enjoyed whilst working in Data Visualisation and Tableau.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">I first used Tableau very infrequently a number of years ago, but I started using it more around 2017. I currently work as a Data Visualisation Developer at Lloyds Banking Group.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">I have to date received five #VizOfTheDay nominations from Tableau Public (&#8216;Skyrim Population&#8217;, &#8216;One Year Of Tweets&#8217;, &#8216;Earth Overshoot Day&#8217;, &#8216;Consult Consult_Ant on Ants&#8217; and &#8216;Goat Butter&#8217;). I am a two-time Tableau Public Ambassador and I am the winner of the Elissa Fink &#8220;WTF I never knew Tableau could do that&#8221; #Vizzie in &#8217;22, &#8217;23 and &#8217;24. I also co-lead the &#8217;24 #Vizzie winning Tableau Public User Group (<a href=\"https:\/\/usergroups.tableau.com\/tableau-public-user-group\/\">https:\/\/usergroups.tableau.com\/tableau-public-user-group\/<\/a>) and co-host the #GamesNightViz community project.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">I have a wife and two daughters, and I am also a keen musician, playing the Saxophone and Clarinet, and play in a few different bands, including <a href=\"http:\/\/www.fleetvilleswingband.co.uk\">Fleetville Swing Band<\/a>. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Just to keep it diverse, I am first dan black belt in Tae Kwon Do and also play at my local tennis club.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>My name is Ant &#8211; welcome to my blog where I share the things I have learned, found interesting, or enjoyed whilst working in Data Visualisation and Tableau. I first used Tableau very infrequently a number of years ago, but I started using it more around 2017. I currently work as a Data Visualisation Developer &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/consult-ant.uk\/home\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">About<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":191258845,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta"